# Rank 2 Mission 2 (battlefield.rank_2_mission_2, Waughroon Shrine: a plain Battlefield with its own entryRequirement
# and checkSkipCutscene; index 0, no fixed area, 15 minutes, 6 players, isMission, Dark_Dragon and Seeker essential, no
# loot, Burning_Circle the exit) by a San d'Oria char. A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with Journey to Bastok (the
# second) current and the Dark Key (GMs). Status 9 (a GM): BC_Entrance: entryRequirement's currentRequirements needs
# Status 10 or more: no options: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY. A trade (a Chunk of Copper Ore): a registrant's trade fails the
# fight that wants none: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY. Status 10: the menu (options 1); area 1 (option 1): registered,
# entered (checkSkipCutscene: Status above 9 and current: skippable). The pair spawns at the first tick; Dark_Dragon and
# Seeker of arena 1 killed (Dark_Dragon's own onMobDeath: the Dark Dragon Slayer title): the essential group's allDeath:
# no armoury crate in the arena: the cutscene timer 5, WON; at the fifth tick after it the timer is out: the cleanup:
# onBattlefieldWin: battlefieldWin 64, 32001; finished: no title, no XP; San d'Oria 2-3's handler (Status 10,
# battlefieldWin 64): the Kindred Crest, the Dark Key taken, Status 11.
lists WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrade WaughroonShrine/onEventUpdate/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Sandoria JourneyToBastok2 current
keyitem DarkKey
item ChunkOfCopperOre
login
missionstatus Sandoria 9                # a GM
trigger BC_Entrance                     # Status 9: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY
trade BC_Entrance ChunkOfCopperOre x1   # a trade: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY
missionstatus Sandoria 10               # a GM
trigger BC_Entrance                     # Status 10: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: registered, entered (skippable)
finish                                  # in the arena
tick 2000                               # Dark_Dragon and Seeker spawn
kill #17367041                          # Dark_Dragon
kill #17367042                          # Seeker: allDeath: no crate: the cutscene timer 5, WON
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000                               # the timer out: the cleanup: 32001
tick 2000                               # nothing more
finish                                 # 2-3: the Kindred Crest, the Dark Key taken, Status 11
